]]"],"published":"2026-04-01","created":"2026-07-07","description":"While the city of Boise proclaimed March 31 as Transgender Day of Visibility, Idaho Gov. Brad Little signed legislation that would make it a crime to use a restroom that doesn’t match the sex assigned at birth."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},